<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Firstar estimates lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Firstar estimates lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth Friday lowered its estimates for Firstar Corp's earnings for both fiscal 1996 and fiscal 1997 after the company said its fourth quarter earnings would fall below analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth said its fiscal 1996 earnings estimate for Firstar is now $3.82, down from $3.95. The new 1997 figure is $4.55, down from the original estimate of $4.65.</p>
<p>-- The bank holding company said Thursday it was experiencing higher-than-expected transitional costs from its restructuring program.</p>
<p>-- Its stock was down 1-1/2 Friday afternoon at 49-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
